 row","The search box"],"unsure_meaning":["מט\"ח (yellow dot next to מניות, with a % under it)","\"ההפקדות 0%\" vs \"מהחיסכון 0.58%\": are those two fees?","The rings next to the percentages: I guessed full = more in stocks","קופה (the number 13874 etc.)","\"עוד לא דווח\"","\"חדש\"","Is 12% a year 'for 5 years' the total or per year? I read it as per year, so about 60% in total"],"not_found":["How much the fee is in shekels on my 30,000 ₪","A button or a first step: how do I actually open one","Something saying which single track is best for someone like me","What's the difference between a קופת גמל להשקעה and just buying the S&P"],"findings":[{"what":"Option א is an endless list of near-identical rows with no return numbers. I almost closed the page there.","where":"Option א, screens 2–5"},{"what":"\"מומלץ\" is on א, but א has no returns. ג is the one that actually helps me choose.","where":"The headings of א and ג"},{"what":"Fees only as tiny %, nothing in shekels, so they all feel like 'nothing'","where":"The דמי ניהול column, all options"},{"what":"מט\"ח with a percentage that's sometimes 99% and sometimes 25%, not explained next to it","where":"The exposure column"},{"what":"Mixed list in ב puts different kinds of tracks next to each other; hard to compare","where":"Option ב"},{"what":"Some rows in ג have no return, just \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", so I can't compare those","where":"Option ג, אלטשולר / אינפיניטי / ילין rows"},{"what":"No first step or button to do anything","where":"Whole page"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3094,"cache_read_input_tokens":17327,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3094},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id"